   "jp": "部屋の外",
   "en": "Leave room",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES77:18cea",
   "off": 101610,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「ゲートは異形の者達の\r  力の源だ\u0010\b  ゲートを閉じることが\r  できれば その力を\r  封じられる」\u0010",
   "en": "\"The Gate is the source of those unnatural beings' power.\u0010\bIf the Gate could be closed, their power would be sealed away.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES77:18d4b",
   "off": 101707,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「光の渦？\u0017しょせんゲート\r  の影にすぎん\u0010\b  バウンダリーゲートを\r  閉じることなど…」\u0010",
   "en": "\"The vortex of light?\u0017 It is merely a shadow of the Gate.\u0010\bAs for closing the Boundary Gate itself...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES77:18da5",
   "off": 101797,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「ゲートを操る力を持つ者は\r  自由にゲートの影を\r  産み出すことができる」\u0010",
   "en": "\"One with the power to control the Gate can create shadows of the Gate at will.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES77:18df2",
   "off": 101874,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「光の渦から現れる化け物\r  どもは\u0010\b  他の世界､他の次元から\r  やってくるのだ…」\u0010",
   "en": "\"The monsters that emerge from the vortex of light...\u0010\bcome from other worlds, other dimensions...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
 ]
}
